      {
         "id": "SECTION_conclusion",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Conclusion</h3>In this text, we looked at some basic shapes used to show our fingers and help us count without extra tools. These methods work well and are easy to remember. But they are not used everywhere. In the next text, we will show some symbols used for counting today.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      }
